playstyle = "Knowledge revealed: scans, sees what is coming, strikes at it.
The Scan deck: bonuses against Scanned enemies, Second Sight of its own (the plan after the next), and punishing what it foresees: more damage to an enemy about to attack, Block for exactly what is coming. Suggested cards: one Scanning every enemy and drawing, one cancelling a foreseen move, cards stronger against a Scanned enemy."
